# ChuckOS package list
# One package per line. Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored.
# Add a package here and re-run `sudo ./build.sh` to include it -- no
# other file needs to change for a plain package addition.

## --- core system ---
tmux
openssh-server
sudo
git
nano
usbutils
htop
vim

## --- audio / MIDI tooling ---
alsa-utils
libasound2-dev

## --- real-time performance tuning ---
linux-cpupower

## --- ChucK build dependencies (matches chuck-1.5.5.8/README.md) ---
build-essential
bison
flex
libsndfile1-dev

## --- networking toggle tools ---
rfkill
iproute2
wireless-tools
firmware-linux-free
firmware-realtek
firmware-iwlwifi

## --- optional, disabled by default: uncomment to add JACK support
##     (the ChuckOS default is ChucK's built-in ALSA driver, no JACK needed) ---
#jackd2
#libjack-jackd2-dev
